    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Little Moon is a 2D adventure game travelling through universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you are landing on a planet and search it, or fly away with 360\u00b0 angle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of puzzles, and mysteries, things that are hard to understand, Interactions with people, storytelling, sail around beautiful universe. Find interesting stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Side-scrolling adventure, shooter, story telling game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120910/extras/f10d9a7e0ebea5ec8a9e568cd4551baa.avif?t=1748664748\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little boy and a girl are living in the little moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lonely tree, a rundown house, everything looks strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a book called 'The Wisdom' has fallen into the moon,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and it tells you that there are many things you don't know</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you have to accept them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of things you don't understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are you ready to accept them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120910/extras/f32e5c0a720a0517257cbd26e410ec8e.avif?t=1748664748\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p>",
